; A transaction may leave a residual of exactly half a unit at its
; commodity's display precision and still balance, at every precision:
; amount_t::is_zero reads the residual in exact arithmetic
; (within_half_unit in src/amount.cc) and counts half a unit as zero.
; Here the residual is 0.00000005 XAU at seven decimals.  The semantic
; bisimulation (test/semantic/check_all.py) replays this journal, so an
; oracle that reads a remainder of exactly half a unit as nonzero rejects
; what C++ accepts.  regress/balance-over-half-unit-residual.test pins
; the other side of the boundary.

commodity XAU
    format 1.0000000 XAU

2024/01/01 half unit p7
    A    1.0000000 XAU
    B    -0.99999995 XAU

test bal
       1.0000000 XAU  A
      -1.0000000 XAU  B
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal --unround
       1.0000000 XAU  A
     -0.99999995 XAU  B
--------------------
      0.00000005 XAU
end test
